doctype html
html(lang="en")
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
    title OGC Web Services (OWS) | OGC Developer
    meta(name="description" content="OGC Web Services (OWS) is a legacy suite of specifications. OGC encourages new implementations to use the modern OGC APIs instead.")
    link(rel="stylesheet" href="assets/style.css")
  body

    include ./includes/corner-ribbon
    include ./includes/header
    +header()

    section.hero.hero-page
      .inner
        div
          .breadcrumb
            a(href="index.html") Developers
            |  / OWS
          h1 OGC Web Services
          p.lead A legacy suite of specifications, superseded by the modern OGC APIs.

    section
      .wrap
        div(style="background:var(--bg-alt);border-left:4px solid var(--navy);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:24px 28px;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto 56px;")
          p(style="margin:0;color:var(--gray-700);font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;")
            | OGC Web Services were created more than ten years ago, when the web technologies looked very different from what is used nowadays. OGC encourages the transition from OWS, and
            a(target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:700;" href="https://docs.ogc.org/pol/05-020r29/05-020r29.html#deprecating-api-elements") "Technical Committee Policies and Procedures 05-020r29"
            |  presents a process for deprecating API elements in OGC Standards. If you are going to implement a standard from scratch, please consider using one of the
            a(style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:700;" href="index.html#get-started") OGC APIs
            |  instead.

        .section-head.left
          p.eyebrow Legacy Standards
          h2(style="font-size:28px;") OGC Web Services (OWS)

        .grid.grid-3
          .card
            .icon-badge
              svg(viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round")
                path(d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71")
                path(d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71")
            h3 Web Feature Service (WFS)
            p Interface for requesting geographic features across the web.
            a.learn(href="https://www.ogc.org/standard/wfs/" target="_blank" rel="noopener") Specification →
          .card
            .icon-badge
              svg(viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round")
                path(d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71")
                path(d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71")
            h3 Web Map Service (WMS)
            p Interface for requesting georeferenced map images over the web.
            a.learn(href="https://www.ogc.org/standard/wms/" target="_blank" rel="noopener") Specification →
          .card
            .icon-badge
              svg(viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round")
                path(d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71")
                path(d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71")
            h3 Web Map Tile Service (WMTS)
            p Interface for serving pre-rendered, georeferenced map tiles.
            a.learn(href="https://www.ogc.org/standard/wmts/" target="_blank" rel="noopener") Specification →
          .card
            .icon-badge
              svg(viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round")
                path(d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71")
                path(d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71")
            h3 Web Processing Service (WPS)
            p Interface for publishing and invoking geospatial processes over the web.
            a.learn(href="https://www.ogc.org/standard/wps/" target="_blank" rel="noopener") Specification →
          .card
            .icon-badge
              svg(viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round")
                path(d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71")
                path(d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71")
            h3 Web Coverage Service (WCS)
            p Interface for accessing multi-dimensional coverage data over the web.
            a.learn(href="https://www.ogc.org/standard/wcs/" target="_blank" rel="noopener") Specification →
          .card
            .icon-badge
              svg(viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round")
                path(d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71")
                path(d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71")
            h3 Web Map Context (WMC)
            p Encoding for the state of a map, so it can be shared between clients.
            a.learn(href="https://www.ogc.org/standard/wmc/" target="_blank" rel="noopener") Specification →
          .card
            .icon-badge
              svg(viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round")
                path(d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71")
                path(d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71")
            h3 Web Coverage Processing Service (WCPS)
            p Query language for filtering and processing multi-dimensional coverages.
            a.learn(href="https://www.ogc.org/standard/wcps/" target="_blank" rel="noopener") Specification →

    include ./includes/cta
    +ctaBox()

    include ./includes/footer
